 "name": "Rock Burst",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/earth-manipulation.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Sculpted Earth</em></p>\n<p>As a reaction, you can cause one of your stone constructs within 60 feet of you to explode. Any creature within 5 feet must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, they take 1d12 bludgeoning damage and are knocked prone. You can spend CE up to half your proficiency bonus (rounded down) as part of this reaction to heighten the explosion and deal an additional 1d12 bludgeoning damage per CE and cause creatures in range to take half as much damage on a success.</p>",
